DELETE /v1/installations/{integrationConfigurationId}/resources/{resourceId}
Delete a resource owned by the selected installation ID.
Required: integrationConfigurationId (path); resourceId (path)

DELETE /v1/installations/{integrationConfigurationId}/resources/{resourceId}/experimentation/items/{itemId}
Delete an existing experimentation item
Required: integrationConfigurationId (path); resourceId (path); itemId (path)

GET /v1/installations/{integrationConfigurationId}/resources/{resourceId}
Get a resource by its partner ID.
Required: integrationConfigurationId (path) — The ID of the integration configuration (installation) the resource belongs to; resourceId (path) — The ID provided by the 3rd party provider for the given resource

GET /v1/installations/{integrationConfigurationId}/billing/invoices/{invoiceId}
Get Invoice details and status for a given invoice ID. See [Billing Events with Webhooks documentation](https://vercel.com/docs/integrations/create-integration/marketplace-api#working-with-billing-events-through-webhooks) on how to receive invoice events. This endpoint is used to retrieve the invoice details.
Required: integrationConfigurationId (path); invoiceId (path)

GET /v1/installations/{integrationConfigurationId}/member/{memberId}
Returns the member role and other information for a given member ID ("user_id" claim in the SSO OIDC token).
Required: integrationConfigurationId (path); memberId (path)
